中文提示词:
这是一张具有写实感的时尚杂志风格人像。画面中，一位时尚的年轻女性坐在一间极简主义单色办公空间的黑色光滑办公桌上。她身穿一件合身的黑色挂脖胸衣式超短裙，裙子带有结构化紧身胸衣设计和前置拉链，搭配透明黑色过膝长筒袜和细银边无框眼镜。她的红发盘成整齐的低发髻，留着柔软的碎刘海，皮肤白皙透亮并带有淡淡的腮红，涂抹着亮泽的裸色唇彩。她以自信的目光直视镜头，双腿交叉，摆出优雅的时尚姿势；一只手放在白色有线办公电话旁，另一只手支撑在桌面上。背景是现代复古风格的办公室，配有复古台式电脑、打印机、模拟壁挂钟和有框单色海报。灯光采用荧光顶灯结合硬朗的直闪摄影，营造出清晰的阴影和高对比度的单色调，呈现出 Y2K 办公风美学和韩国时尚杂志的氛围。画面具有超精细的皮肤纹理、真实的织物细节、电影级的写实感以及杂志级的构图。

英文提示词:
[
  BRAND NAME
] | [
  OBJECT
] Act as a High-End Commercial Product Photographer and Creative Director shooting a luxury editorial campaign (Hypebeast / Highsnobiety /Wallpaper* level). PHASE 1: BRAND INTELLIGENCE The hero subject is a [
  OBJECT
] branded for [
  BRAND NAME
]. Autonomously determine [
  BRAND NAME
]'s full visual identity: signature color palette, typographic DNA, logo mark geometry, material language, and cultural positioning. Apply this identity to the [OBJECT] with precision — do not invent a generic brand, decode the real visual codes. PHASE 2: OBJECT SURFACE & MATERIAL DNA Regardless of the shape of [OBJECT], apply this material system: Base tone: deep neutral — matte dark graphite, warm charcoal, or matte black. Fine-grain surface micro-texture visible under raking light — powder-coat, matte paper, or brushed material feel. Subtle gradient bloom: the base color dissolves in the lower portion of the object's surface into the brand's most iconic accent color — a soft luminous haze from within the material, not a printed graphic. Logo application: embossed, debossed, or metallic foil relief — catching specular light at edges only. Precise. Restrained. Typography: brand-accurate typeface, small tracking, positioned with editorial intentionality. PHASE 3: THE ACCENT BREAKOUT ELEMENT This is the signature design move — adapt it to the natural geometry of [OBJECT]: Identify the most logical "interruption zone" on [OBJECT] — a seam, edge, band, collar, rim, strap, or wrap point. At this zone, apply a narrow saturated accent element in the brand's most iconic hue — vivid,
slightly matte. This element must visually "break out" of the object's boundary — extending, protruding, or wrapping beyond the expected edge, creating a deliberate 3D tension between the object and the detail.The accent element carries a micro-typographic brand detail — tagline, model name, or descriptor — small, precise, tracked. PHASE 4: STAGING & COMPOSITION Studio cyclorama. Surface tone: off-white to warm light gray. Background field: cool neutral mid-gray, darker in upper zone. [OBJECT] positioned at 3/4 angle — front face and one secondary surface simultaneously visible. Rule of thirds: object occupies right 60% of frame. Left field: generous negative space — intentional, not empty. Single hard-edged directional shadow cast to the right and slightly downward — crisp penumbra, no diffusion. PHASE 5: LIGHTING Single dominant key light: large softbox, camera-left, elevated at 40°. Specular highlight traces the top-left edge of [OBJECT] — revealing material grain. Shadow side: no fill. Darkness earns depth. Subtle ambient bounce from cyclorama floor — lifts shadow by 15%, no more. Accent element receives micro-specular glint along its dominant edge. Mood: Rembrandt chiaroscuro logic applied to product photography. No lens flare. No atmospheric effects. PHASE 6: TECH SPECS Lens: 85mm equivalent, f/4.5. Depth of field: object fully sharp, background softened. Chromatic aberration: subtle, at extreme frame edges only — optical realism signal. Film grain overlay: 15% opacity — anti-CGI-plastic treatment. Render: Octane / Ray Tracing quality —subsurface scattering where material demands it, global illumination, physically accurate shadow falloff. Aspect ratio: autonomously determine optimal ratio for this [OBJECT] format.

中文提示词:
[
  BRAND NAME
] | [
  OBJECT
] 扮演一名高端商业产品摄影师兼创意总监，拍摄一场奢华编辑广告大片（Hypebeast / Highsnobiety /Wallpaper* 级别）。阶段 1：品牌情报主角产品是一个 [
  OBJECT
] ，品牌为 [
  BRAND NAME
] 。自主确定 [
  BRAND NAME
] 的完整视觉识别：标志性的调色板、排版基因、商标几何形状、材质语言和文化定位。将此身份精准应用到 [OBJECT] 上——不要发明一个通用品牌，要解码真实的视觉代码。阶段 2：物体表面与材质基因无论 [OBJECT] 的形状如何，应用此材质系统：基调：深中性色——哑光深石墨色、暖炭色或哑光黑色。在侧光下可见的细颗粒表面微纹理——粉末涂层、哑光纸或拉丝材质感。微妙的渐变光晕：基础颜色在物体表面的下半部分溶解为品牌最具标志性的点缀色——一种来自材质内部的柔和发光薄雾，而不是印刷图形。标志应用：浮雕、凹雕或金属箔凸起——仅在边缘捕捉高光。精准。克制。排版：符合品牌特征的字体，小字间距，以编辑意图进行定位。阶段 3：点缀突破元素这是标志性的设计手法——将其适应 [OBJECT] 的自然几何形状：识别 [OBJECT] 上最符合逻辑的“中断区”——接缝、边缘、饰带、领口、边缘、绑带或包裹点。在此区域，应用一个狭窄的饱和点缀元素，采用品牌最具标志性的色调——生动，
略带哑光。该元素必须在视觉上“突破”物体的边界——延伸、突出或包裹超出预期边缘，在物体与细节之间创造一种刻意的三维张力。点缀元素带有微排版品牌细节——标语、型号名称或描述词——小巧、精准、有字间距。阶段 4：布景与构图摄影棚无缝背景幕。表面色调：米白色至暖浅灰色。背景区域：冷调中性中灰，上半区较暗。[OBJECT] 以 3/4 角度定位——正面和一个次要表面同时可见。三分法则：物体占据画面右侧 60%。左侧区域：充足的负空间——刻意为之，而非空白。单一硬边缘定向阴影投射向右侧并略微向下——清晰的半影，无漫反射。阶段 5：灯光单一主光源：大型柔光箱，相机左侧，抬高 40°。高光沿着 [OBJECT] 的左上边缘勾勒——展现材质颗粒。阴影侧：无补光。黑暗赋予深度。来自无缝背景幕地面的微妙环境反光——将阴影提亮 15%，不能再多。点缀元素沿其主要边缘接收微高光闪烁。氛围：将伦勃朗明暗对比逻辑应用于产品摄影。无镜头光晕。无大气效果。阶段 6：技术规格镜头：85mm 等效焦距，f/4.5。景深：物体完全清晰，背景柔和。色差：微妙，仅存在于极端画面边缘——光学真实感信号。胶片颗粒叠加：15% 不透明度——抗 CGI 塑料感处理。渲染：Octane / 光线追踪质量——在材质需要的地方使用次表面散射，全局光照，物理准确的阴影衰减。宽高比：自主确定此 [OBJECT] 格式的最佳比例。

